### Graphify ###
# Knowledge-graph state. Regenerate with: graphify update .
.graphify/
# Pre-0.17 layout, kept so an unmigrated tree stays ignored (see graphify migrate-state)
graphify-out/
# Installed CLI. The pin and lockfile ARE tracked; restore with:
#   cd tools/graphify && npm install --ignore-scripts
tools/graphify/node_modules/

### OpenCode Goal Plugin ###
.opencode/goals/

### OpenCode nested config guard ###
# A nested .opencode/ dir is created when opencode runs with a cwd inside
# .opencode/. Its node_modules/*.md files get registered as phantom agents.
.opencode/**/.opencode/